{"id":"043908345fb04de3","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-total-order.md","title":"Total Order","display":"df-total-order — Total Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-total-order","aliases":["58-df-total-order"],"display":"df-total-order — Total Order","depends_on":["[[58-df-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-total-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-total-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-total-order — Total Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"58-df-partial-order\">58-df-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R\\in V\">\\(P,R\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq P\\times P\">\\(R\\subseteq P\\times P\\)</span> (carrier and binary relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83dfbde66bc78255\" href=\"?note=83dfbde66bc78255\" title=\"58-df-partial-order\">58-df-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)\\)</span> (total-order predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>全序是同时满足偏序性和可比性的二元关系</li>\n<li>任何两个不同元素在该关系下都可比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"83dfbde66bc78255","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-partial-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq P\\times P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}order}\\vdash \\operatorname{TotalOrder}(P,R)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartOrd}(P,R)\\land\\forall x,y\\in P\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":823,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a9e71fcecda1ed2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotalOrder}$ (reflexive total-order predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]])"},{"id":"ab96223acaba295d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"若要求这些性质，参见 [[../batch19/58-df-partial-order.md]] 和 [[../batch20/58-df-total-order.md]]"},{"id":"4ba26c58